{"id":"666725","name":"苹果炖猪排","author":"金凤栖梧","authorId":"8221247","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/666725/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"梅花肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"苹果","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"2勺"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"黑胡椒粉","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"玉米油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"备好食材，梅花肉切成一定厚度的片。","img":"images/666725/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"用刀背敲上去，两边都敲一下。","img":"images/666725/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入盆中，加盐，蒜片，黑胡椒粉，油拌匀，腌40分钟左右。","img":"images/666725/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"苹果切片，葱蒜切段。","img":"images/666725/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"油热放入腌好的肉片。","img":"images/666725/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"分钟后翻片，煎至两面金黄捞出。","img":"images/666725/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"下入葱蒜炒香。","img":"images/666725/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入苹果炒一会儿。","img":"images/666725/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"肉片放上面。","img":"images/666725/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入生抽，蚝油，料酒，白糖。","img":"images/666725/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加开水没过苹果与肉，大火烧开，中小火炖20分钟。","img":"images/666725/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"大开收汤。","img":"images/666725/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/666725/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/666725/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/666725/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}